  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::M3StartingItems
  items:
  - itemID: m3_dao_mo
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 541fc11fb2817084dbf14cbd2d6ddeea, type: 3}
  introDelay: 1.5
  introLines:
  - "...M\xECnh \u0111ang \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u? L\u1EA7n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0 h\u1EA7m tr\xFA \u1EA9n... c\xF2n \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t v\u0103n ph\xF2ng."
  - "C\u1EDD \u0111\u1ECF, bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng con m\u1EAFt... v\xE0 b\u1EE9c ch\xE2n dung kia. Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 n\xE0o... l\xE0 em trai m\xECnh?"
  - "Ch\xFAng \u0111\xE3 l\u1EE5c so\xE1t m\xECnh... May m\xE0 con dao m\u1ED5 v\u1EABn gi\u1EA5u trong tay \xE1o."
  - "Ph\u1EA3i t\xECm hi\u1EC3u chuy\u1EC7n g\xEC \u0111\xE3 x\u1EA3y ra \u1EDF d\xF2ng th\u1EDDi gian n\xE0y. S\u1ED5 tay \u1EDF g\xF3c tr\xEAn s\u1EBD ghi l\u1EA1i m\u1ECDi manh m\u1ED1i."
  secondsBetweenLines: 4.5
